// PAULA - AUTOMATIC IN-CAR BANTER

{
	name: hh_paula_banter_1

	text: "Mind if I sing? On stage I learned not to let silence take over the room."
	text_hh: paula_stripper

	text: "As long as you don't charge me admission."

	text: "For you, I'll give a friend discount."
	text_hh: paula_stripper
}

{
	name: hh_paula_banter_2
	req: rain

	text: "Ten years under hot lights and I still can't get used to being rained on."
	text_hh: paula_stripper

	text: "You don't like the rain?"

	text: "I like watching it from inside. Glamour has its limits."
	text_hh: paula_stripper
}

{
	name: hh_paula_banter_3
	req: night

	text: "At night, every city seems to promise you can start over."
	text_hh: paula_stripper

	text: "And do you believe it?"

	text: "Tonight I do. Tomorrow I'll give you a more dramatic answer."
	text_hh: paula_stripper
}

{
	name: hh_paula_banter_4
	req: music_playing

	text: "This song has a great beat. I almost feel like getting up to dance."
	text_hh: paula_stripper

	text: "Almost?"

	text: "I'm not doing choreography with my seat belt on."
	text_hh: paula_stripper
}

{
	name: hh_paula_banter_5
	req: weather_clear

	text: "With a sky like this, it almost feels like life has everything under control."
	text_hh: paula_stripper

	text: "And when it's cloudy?"

	text: "Then at least the sky and I are on the same page."
	text_hh: paula_stripper
}
